    "steam_appid": 1848490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848490/extras/f22719529aaa69f1537ebe8917bf5659.poster.avif?t=1753929946\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848490/extras/f22719529aaa69f1537ebe8917bf5659.webp?t=1753929946\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Protect Bunnygirl from her foes</h2><br>In You Are NOT Bunnygirl, you control a robot who wakes up deep underground.  You must protect her from her malfunctioning siblings, the dangers of the Lab, and even her own emotions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manage Physical and Emotional Health in a story about self-care<br></li><li>Explore an atmospheric world with a minimalistic color aesthetic<br></li><li>Synth-based soundtrack with lots of reverb<br></li><li>Emotionally scarred NPCs<br></li><li>The save point is a couch<br></li><li>The save point is also a lesbian<br></li><li>The save point will yell at you if you're bad at the game</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848490/extras/f22719529aaa69f1537ebe8917bf5659.poster.avif?t=1753929946\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848490/extras/f22719529aaa69f1537ebe8917bf5659.webp?t=1753929946\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Protect Bunnygirl from her foes</h2><br>In You Are NOT Bunnygirl, you control a robot who wakes up deep underground.  You must protect her from her malfunctioning siblings, the dangers of the Lab, and even her own emotions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manage Physical and Emotional Health in a story about self-care<br></li><li>Explore an atmospheric world with a minimalistic color aesthetic<br></li><li>Synth-based soundtrack with lots of reverb<br></li><li>Emotionally scarred NPCs<br></li><li>The save point is a couch<br></li><li>The save point is also a lesbian<br></li><li>The save point will yell at you if you're bad at the game</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You Are NOT Bunnygirl is an RPG about self-care! Manage Physical and Emotional Health as you guide Bunnygirl through a lab of malfunctioning robots. You can't actually lose, because it's a game, but you should protect Bunnygirl anyways because she might not appreciate it if you don't.",
